{"id":"n88010-1-7","stage":4,"title":"화산 · 火山","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n88010-1-7-1","ko":"저 산은 현재도 활동 중이에요.","zh":"那座山现在仍在活动呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71215","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"산은","meaning":"山","explanation":"산：山；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"산","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20954","senseId":"1","lemma":"산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"산은","audio":"/audio/456913f205c025f0cdb6.mp3"}},{"text":"현재도","meaning":"现在","explanation":"현재：现在；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"현재","audio":"/audio/72d2bae2a744d54f0940.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62447","senseId":"1","lemma":"현재","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"현재도","audio":"/audio/89d15d00333aac4866bd.mp3"}},{"text":"활동","meaning":"活动","explanation":"활동：活动。","readings":[{"term":"활동","audio":"/audio/d4b47a5cf76094e95719.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74135","senseId":"2","lemma":"활동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"활동","audio":"/audio/d4b47a5cf76094e95719.mp3"}},{"text":"중이에요.","meaning":"处在某状态的期间。","explanation":"중：处在某状态的期间；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"3","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중이에요","audio":"/audio/20e988fe68ce4da268a7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71215","definition":"用于指示与话者、听者离得很远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"ab367eb9a60ab986","term":"산","zh":"山","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3","entryId":"20954","definition":"比平地高耸出很多，大多有着树木、草、石头等的土地。","pronunciation":["산"]},{"id":"72d2bae2a744d54f","term":"현재","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/72d2bae2a744d54f0940.mp3","entryId":"62447","definition":"就在当前这个时候。","pronunciation":["현ː재"]},{"id":"d4b47a5cf76094e9","term":"활동","zh":"活动","audio":"/audio/d4b47a5cf76094e95719.mp3","entryId":"74135","definition":"为在某事中取得好结果而努力。","pronunciation":["활똥"]},{"id":"b558d7af71515538","term":"중","zh":"处在某状态的期间。","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3","entryId":"79404","definition":"处在某状态的期间。","pronunciation":["중"]}],"audio":"/audio/f6d9a1659ec1ad0c4594.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n88010-1-7-2","ko":"저런, 그럼 화산이 언제 또 폭발할지 모르겠네요.","zh":"哎呀，那可真不知道火山什么时候会再次喷发啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저런,","meaning":"啊，哎呀","explanation":"저런：啊，哎呀。","readings":[{"term":"저런","audio":"/audio/2f66dcda6095507e43b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71224","senseId":"1","lemma":"저런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저런","audio":"/audio/2f66dcda6095507e43b6.mp3"}},{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样。","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"화산이","meaning":"火山","explanation":"화산：火山；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"화산","audio":"/audio/991967151e76ef00b597.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88010","senseId":"1","lemma":"화산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"화산이","audio":"/audio/f1611fc4422521b4e2db.mp3"}},{"text":"언제","meaning":"什么时候","explanation":"언제：什么时候。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17860","senseId":"1","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}},{"text":"또","meaning":"又","explanation":"또：又。","readings":[{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51887","senseId":"1","lemma":"또","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}},{"text":"폭발할지","meaning":"爆发","explanation":"폭발하다：爆发；ㄹ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"폭발하다","audio":"/audio/3f42b80a0a7e18565ffe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83490","senseId":"3","lemma":"폭발하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"폭발할지","audio":"/audio/246523928df234cb0a4a.mp3"}},{"text":"모르겠네요.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르겠네요","audio":"/audio/e3f02295bf5ea4c430fc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2f66dcda6095507e","term":"저런","zh":"啊，哎呀","audio":"/audio/2f66dcda6095507e43b6.mp3","entryId":"71224","definition":"听到没料到的、惊奇或可惜的事情时说的词语。","pronunciation":["저런"]},{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"991967151e76ef00","term":"화산","zh":"火山","audio":"/audio/991967151e76ef00b597.mp3","entryId":"88010","definition":"地下的可燃气体或熔岩冲破地表后爆发出来；或指因此生成的山。","pronunciation":["화ː산"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"什么时候","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17860","definition":"不知道的某时。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"c7c5916d2df73410","term":"또","zh":"又","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3","entryId":"51887","definition":"某件事情或行为再次发生。","pronunciation":["또"]},{"id":"3f42b80a0a7e1856","term":"폭발하다","zh":"爆发","audio":"/audio/3f42b80a0a7e18565ffe.mp3","entryId":"83490","definition":"某个事件突然发生。","pronunciation":["폭빨하다"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9321547c0f08d8071194.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.11,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=88010","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":148,"sequenceScore":2.9367,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["哎呀，那可真不知道火山什么时候会再次喷发啊。","外国人在学习韩语时，觉得什么最难呢？","那座山现在仍在活动呢。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["哎呀，那可真不知道火山什么时候会再次喷发啊。","那座山现在仍在活动呢。","外国人在学习韩语时，觉得什么最难呢？"],"answer":0}]}
